  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups cranberries",
    "1 large orange, cut into small pieces",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 cup chopped celery",
    "1 cup finely chopped walnuts",
    "1 cup crushed pineapple, drained",
    "1 (3 ounce) package raspberry flavored Jell-O® mix",
    "2 cups hot water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HxE_9Tczl-8klLw7YyTRZ22aSyE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13466-cranberry-salad-ii-VAT-step-01-03879b09c2784bd98d5768f72875c8ce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13466/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cranberries, orange (including rind), and sugar in a food processor. Pulse together until cranberries and orange are coarsely chopped and well combined with sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9958x0cx3yYoxguMCYJNvvZL05I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13466-cranberry-salad-ii-VAT-step-02-1ac1ef5e33f341ed97029de3d97bc132.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13466/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a bowl. Stir in celery, walnuts, and pineapple until thoroughly mixed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0RD_ALmF7a_1HJI3nuQDJKPKf80=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13466-cranberry-salad-ii-VAT-step-03-a4959385a1c14dcf81e6a710595192a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13466/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place gelatin in a bowl and pour hot water over top; whisk immediately to dissolve completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J-5anz6ukjneM4aH-hfnQNOqP0U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13466-cranberry-salad-ii-VAT-step-04-ee483024b80f4efbbe3406921755e7e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13466/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour gelatin over the cranberry mixture. Stir to combine.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I96pU8XNaQE0lpkH4Pl08J6gycc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13466-cranberry-salad-ii-VAT-step-05-fc92d33f92a641e0b753f907554654f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13466/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into the mold of your choice and chill until you are ready to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
